Media card: song position runs on from the iPhone's last report (2026-10-12).

The iPhone sends the elapsed time only when playback jumps (start, pause, seek). Every other NowPlaying
update re-sent that old position as the current one, and a page that (re)connected got it too, so the
car's media card jumped back. The box now keeps the time of the report and the iPhone's playing state,
and sends the position as of the moment it sends; the page runs the clock on the iPhone's playing state
instead of whether the browser hears sound (navigation prompts, locked sound).

